WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.740
 The cost of writing code is zero and you can ship fast.

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:09.260
 What's the point of reviewing codes that you can instantly fix anyway?

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:14.240
 The only thing is, there is a difference in reviewing between having a bug and not working

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:16.600
 and having it working but being insecure.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:24.360
 Yes, but at some point the models will also be able to write better code than any found engineers.

